<p>Perfectly fine start; bad end. The '<em>It was all cultists!</em>' angle didn't really serve it, and just brings the pacing to a screeching halt. Everybody's read crazy cult hymns, and these ones aren't particularly special, nor is the group very <em>anything</em>. It just is. While there might not be much frighteningly unique about the first half, I'd say it'd work better with just 2-5. -7 is humorous, but would probably be a detriment to the tone.</p>

